  "reason": "The existing evidence is limited to a multimodal baseline (config_016) with moderate performance, but no direct comparison to single-modality baselines exists. This experiment will test a single-modality RNA-only model using the same PCA encoder as config_016, isolating the impact of modality choice. It directly addresses uncertainty about whether multimodal approaches provide meaningful benefits over single-modality models, which is a critical design decision. This comparison is informative and aligns with the principle of reducing uncertainty about important choices with minimal additional complexity."
